Vox2Cortex
https://github.com/ai-med/Vox2Cortex

The following functions in wmba/mesh_utils.py are adapted from Vox2Cortex:

    normalize_vertices_per_max_dim
    unnormalize_vertices_per_max_dim
    normalize_vertices_flip
    voxelize_mesh_trimesh
    get_occupied_voxels_trimesh
    aggregate_trilinear
    aggregate_from_indices

